{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的音乐细节和感受出现时点不如Y细致，部分音乐变化与人物心理之间的对应关系也没有Y具体。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让观众可以先顺着完整句子理解人物正在经历什么，再用右侧短词补充感受，阅读路径比较稳定，尤其在18秒、19秒的短段落里更容易消化。Y的重点放大和感受按音乐时点出现很有优势，人物心理与音乐细节也更丰富，但不少段落的信息密度明显偏高，容易让观众忙于辨认和阅读，反而削弱对故事的连续感受。总体而言，Y的细腻度胜出，X的实际观看流畅度和叙事理解更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "64731391-48ad-4671-b6de-5912bf6b97b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045326235045Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.204, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:54:06.465114+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d972333079bd2d8882ccb6a1ad55a961871fd165c2fc1bfad87e5e1135d0facb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta